<title>USA: Equity Marketing names Welch CFO.</title>
<headline>Equity Marketing names Welch CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Marketing Inc said Michael Welch was named senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The posting becomes effective January 9, when current chief financial officer, Kenneth Fisher, resigns to pursue &quot;personal business interests,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Welch was most recently vice president of corporate development for Mattel.</p>
